{"book":"hono","chapter":"helpers","chapterTitle":"المساعدات","slug":"dev","title":"مساعد التطوير","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"getroutername","text":"getRouterName()"},{"depth":2,"id":"showroutes","text":"showRoutes()"},{"depth":2,"id":"الخيارات","text":"الخيارات"},{"depth":3,"id":"verbose-boolean","text":"verbose: boolean"},{"depth":3,"id":"colorize-boolean","text":"colorize: boolean"}],"html":"<p>يوفّر Dev Helper طرقاً مفيدة يمكنك استخدامها أثناء التطوير.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { getRouterName, showRoutes } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/dev&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"getroutername\"><code>getRouterName()</code></h2>\n<p>يمكنك الحصول على اسم الموجِّه (router) المستخدَم حالياً عبر <code>getRouterName()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getRouterName</span>(app))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"showroutes\"><code>showRoutes()</code></h2>\n<p><code>showRoutes()</code> تعرض الدالة المسارات المسجَّلة في وحدة التحكم (console) لديك.</p>\n<p>تأمّل تطبيقًا كالتالي:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basePath</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/v1&#x27;</span>)\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">showRoutes</span>(app, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">verbose</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>,\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>عند بدء تشغيل هذا التطبيق، ستظهر المسارات في وحدة التحكم الخاصة بك على النحو التالي:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-txt\">GET   /v1/posts\nGET   /v1/posts/:id\nPOST  /v1/posts\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الخيارات\">الخيارات</h2>\n<h3 id=\"verbose-boolean\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> verbose: <code>boolean</code></h3>\n<p>عند الضبط على <code>true</code>، فإنه يعرض معلومات مفصّلة.</p>\n<h3 id=\"colorize-boolean\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> colorize: <code>boolean</code></h3>\n<p>عند الضبط على <code>false</code>، فلن يكون الناتج ملوّنًا.</p>\n"}